  "commentCnt": 0,
  "headCont": "전기 자기",
  "contentval": "0005Ozzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/334",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;김정식 선생님의 사이트</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(<a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/)\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/)</a></span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">에서 전기 그네를 만들어 미니 과학관을 운영하는 자료를 보았는데요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. ‘</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 편리한 방법이</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">?’ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">따라하기로 완성하였습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">점심시간에 과학실로 와서</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">귀여운</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(?) </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">기기를 작동하는 학생들의 밝은 표정을 보니 저도 덩달아 기분이 좋습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">김정식 선생님 덕분입니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">감사합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. ^^</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;만드는 방법은 간단합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">결과도 확실하고요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">티슈 상자의 한쪽 면을 잘라내고</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">구리 선</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지름 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">0.1cm)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">을 구부려 그네 모양으로 걸쳐 놓으면 됩니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">저는 구리 선의 피복을 벗겨서 사용했는데 피복이 없는 선이 있다면 더 편리하겠습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;말굽자석의 끝부분에 그네를 두면 움직임이 더욱 명확합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자기장의 세기는 자석의 양 끝이 크니까요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;다양한 방법으로 시도해 보았습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">건전지</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: 6V 1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">개 혹은 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1.5V 3</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">개를 직렬로 연결</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">스위치</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">연결 혹은 연결하지 않음</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자석</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">말굽자석 혹은 둥근 네오디뮴 자석을 사용</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb2d631987ea36cb855e6b7af73143a6fca0a412\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb2d631987ea36cb855e6b7af73143a6fca0a412\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f746a4e6eaf336e98c1602d1b0459e57c7d13306\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f746a4e6eaf336e98c1602d1b0459e57c7d13306\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;구리 대신 에나멜선을 둥글게 감아</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">잘라낸 종이컵에 대충 걸쳐 실험해 보았습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">결과는 확실한데 에나멜선이 뜨거워지는 문제가 있습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3faeaf0db7f7ba39b73fb9ab8d1972a05f40c638\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3faeaf0db7f7ba39b73fb9ab8d1972a05f40c638\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e6cac63216975cbab592289c1cba39802a770ad\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9e6cac63216975cbab592289c1cba39802a770ad\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a69fb214677214f99a6492265e4e2c6ab62726c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a69fb214677214f99a6492265e4e2c6ab62726c7\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;오랫동안 다양한 주제로 과학 동아리를 운영하였는데요</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">미니 전기 그네를 만들었던 생각이 나서 예전 자료</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(2010</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">년</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">를 찾아 공유합니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생들의 의견을 반영하여 추억의 똑딱이 스위치를 넣어 작동하였습니다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rviiij2eikl0ya6yngjha6p5f@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rviiij2eikl0ya6yngjha6p5f/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33285446200&amp;signature=J66wAE%2FbDHcdkD%2BCdTrYeC8FzqQ%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rviiij2eikl0ya6yngjha6p5f?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2aWlpajJlaWtsMHlhNnluZ2poYTZwNWYiLCJ0aWQiOiI5NmQ0OWZiYi0xODIwLTRhNzAtOTE0ZS1jMjcxYzA1NjU4MWMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODI3MzZ9.R4hcb3gkTxEefHjUAzh0u9yCXpN5CeyrD6xFCfcH8_a_nrwXtsRTk9PuQITeff9iGhNlPRB6G5p5P5UyohH9JA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3332fe99916e1b347446b2099701f2679e16c6f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3332fe99916e1b347446b2099701f2679e16c6f\" data-origin-width=\"1033\" data-origin-height=\"2477\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
